# ⚡ Snap-to-Wallet

> **Frictionless Web3 Onboarding & Instant Wallet Generation via Optical Entropy** > *Developed for Solana Startup Village Hackathon 2026*

---

## 📌 Project Overview
Snap-to-Wallet is a zero-friction onboarding solution designed to eliminate standard Web3 entry barriers at events and offline locations. By leveraging camera sensor entropy, users can create secure keypairs and complete transactions in under 1.5 seconds via a simple QR-code flow.

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack & Architecture
- **Blockchain:** Solana (Devnet / Mainnet-Beta), Solana Pay, SPL Token Extensions
- **Mobile & Core:** Android (Kotlin) / React Native, Ed25519 SDK
- **Security:** Hardware Secure Enclave / Android Keystore

